{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:26 2026-11-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:26 2026-11-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:26 2026-11-26 HKT</p><img alt=\"宏福苑大火一周年，香港道教聯合會辦追思道場。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/706055b7650061da4851582e366873b6/2026-11/page_226.jpg\"/><p>宏福苑大火一周年，今早（26日）香港道教聯合會在粉嶺蓬瀛仙館設立「宏福苑火災周年祈福追思道場」，開放予公眾致祭；開放時間由早上9時至下午5時。</p><p>早上10時，道場內舉行追思儀式，由一眾道士主持。現場擺滿用作拜祭「大埔宏福苑火災罹難者眾靈」的祭品。香港道教聯合會主席梁德華亦率領會眾致祭。</p><img alt=\"香港道教聯合會在粉嶺蓬瀛仙館設立「宏福苑火災周年祈福追思道場」。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cee3edbf20f10575dce46c6b661d64f9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_09_46_24_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5c1945e1f95fd95888e0eda4aa7f052b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_09_46_24.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"儀式由一眾道士主持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/11e290bb243f12c8134a2072dc1e8ee9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_09_46_23_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3d4bb71118ce9d1a95a8d029291abdbf/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_09_46_23_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"香港道教聯合會主席梁德華率領會眾致祭。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c8f7600ae4e1bd6bdfafc4c7be6acc1d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_10_17_52.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"香港道教聯合會主席梁德華率領會眾致祭。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/502e0cdd857b9e2d5d1958cc16e71a65/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_10_17_52_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f108d60cf168dfa27100a66630ba3b05/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_10_17_51.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場擺滿用作拜祭「大埔宏福苑火災罹難者眾靈」的祭品\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4bf08b3e4ae72c0e9419fd5184cb305e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_09_46_22_2_.jpeg\"/><p>香港道教聯合會早前通告舉行是次追思活動，指宏福大火轉瞬一年，但不少市民仍受事件影響，心懷傷痛，心靈未安。啟建祈福追思道場是要超度亡靈、禳除火厄，撫慰受火災影響市民的心靈，並祈願香港社會團結和諧。</p><img alt=\"宏福苑大火一周年，香港道教聯合會辦追思道場。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e079fbc26d257dfac4f6a0cc7a5ddf85/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_10_34_37.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7a7b30281596123c20ec660b9c95105a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_10_34_36_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c996844031984cbd1e95ce22d2192b11/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_10_34_36_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b45d04469d599056096cb8a3d5f6f16c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_10_34_35.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"香港道教聯合會主席梁德華致悼念辭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3c215a42c59559c8e3d8921e95fe2d00/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_10_30_21.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/58e4594c37546870f27f05f7059191ff/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_09_46_22_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/74d0ee824c437417d8c13270c2055740/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_09_46_23.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a43c9d6e746cf0430639ee7983f6ea32/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_09_46_22.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a4251a9e0f072aee651163eb0bf838e0/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_09_46_21.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5aeaf77f5a32a7cc1ab576f07fabb557/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_10_17_53.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2bb301693c1ee52c349efeb510ebd25c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_10_17_52_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b5c5b71b24a0ee9e0ccba1e1db90b64/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_11_05_08.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97e1786aafecd9e7b7e3461fc789abce/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_11_05_06_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T03:50:41.487820+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":22,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"publishe